Package: gnome-shell-extension-multi-column-dock
Architecture: all
Depends: gnome-shell (>= 45), libglib2.0-bin, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Multi-column dock for GNOME Shell with app grouping
 A customizable multi-column dock for GNOME Shell.
 Keep your apps neatly organized with grouping, smooth scrolling,
 easy drag-and-drop reordering, auto-hide, and full multi-monitor support.
 .
 Features:
  - Collapsible app groups with custom colors
  - Multi-column layout (1-5 columns)
  - Auto-hide with hot zone
  - HiDPI/4K support
  - Notification badges
